cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Burst Detector: a real-time network burst detection plugin for the Open Ephys GUI"
abstract: >-
  Open Ephys GUI plugin for real-time detection of single-channel and network
  bursts in extracellular recordings, based on the maximum interval method
  (Cotterill et al., 2016). Each detected network burst triggers a TTL output,
  enabling closed-loop, state-dependent stimulation (e.g. optogenetic burst
  termination) in in vitro MEA experiments.
